  "text": "Iqa‘ Fallahi 2/4 Iqa‘ Index Pronunciation of Fallahi Iqa‘ Fallahi is a fast-paced Egyptian iqa‘ suitable for folk music. Although it might resemble Maqsum played at double speed, it has a very different feel as Fallahi flows very smoothly without a big contrast (in accents) between dum and tak beats. il-Benti Beida Vocals and Music by Metqal Qannawi Hizz Ya Hubb Vocals by Ahmad Adaweya Music by Hassan Abu el-Su‘ud Salametha Ummu Hasan Vocals by Ahmad Adaweya Music by Faruq Salamah Iqa‘ Fallahi 2/4 Tabla demonstration by Faisal Zedan",
